; c16-3t-guarded-second. Anchor: shot-0233 (Ch. 16, three trumps).
; Printed: 0.47 (38 of 81 placements).
; Claim: with three trumps, the double among them but not the second-highest,
;   an opponent holds that trump with another trump beside it.
; State: the bidder's seven tiles, nothing played; the 21 others dealt
;   uniformly, seven to each other seat.
; Exact: 388/855. Book model: 38/81.
;
; The same relation as c16-4t-guarded-second, over a hand one trump shorter.
(query
  (viewer v)
  (opponent v x)
  (in t q*)
  (in o q*)
  (none (roles u y) (in u q*) (beats u t q*) (not (viewer y)) (holds y u))
  (holds x t)
  (holds x o))
